{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Blast radius measured empirically (py3.12, uv sync --locked --extra dev, i.e. the exact CI lane): **38 tests** are permanently skipped, across 11 files — not just the review-bot directory.\n\nTwo modules are missing in the CI lane, not one:\n- `fastapi` — from the `reviewbot` AND `ui` extras\n- `jinja2` — from the `ui` extra\n\nEverything else that is importorskip-gated (uvicorn, httpx, boto3, starlette, jsonschema, pydantic_ai, mcp, yaml, ...) already resolves transitively under `dev` — `dev` pulls `nava-rebar[agents,metrics]` plus boto3/botocore directly. So the `--extra agents` on test.yml:101 is redundant, and boto3-gated tests were never skipped.\n\nBreakdown: 17 function-scope skips + 21 tests in 3 wholly-skipped modules.\n- review-bot / opcert: test_review_bot.py (6), test_review_bot_token_redaction.py (4), test_review_bot_retrigger.py (2), test_review_bot_in_flight.py (1), test_path_injection_guards.py (1), test_opcert_service_app.py (whole module)\n- audit UI (the `ui` extra, same root cause): test_audit_serve.py (1), test_audit_serve_heldout.py (1), test_plan_review_health_surfaces.py (1, jinja2), test_audit_ticket_page.py + _heldout.py (whole modules)\n\nFINDING — two of those modules were not merely skipped, they were BROKEN: test_audit_ticket_page.py:21 and test_audit_ticket_page_heldout.py:21 do `from tests.unit import _audit_page_helpers`, but nothing ever puts the repo root on sys.path (tests/conftest.py:38 inserts tests/, not the root, and there is no tests/__init__.py). Installing fastapi turns those two modules from SKIP into a collection ERROR. Fixed to `from unit import _audit_page_helpers` (tests/ is on sys.path, so `unit` resolves as a namespace package). No other test had a latent failure — with the extras installed all 38 pass."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786099487484939001,"uuid":"86360a38-f34c-4067-8172-a4c601bce41d"}